Package: NICHESv2
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Cell-to-Cell Ligand-Receptor Communication Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given="NICHESv2", family="Authors", role=c("aut","cre"), email="niches@example.com")
Description: Computes ligand-receptor (LR) signalling scores between spatially
    neighbouring cells in single-cell spatial transcriptomics data. Returns a
    NICHESObject (13-slot S3 class) with per-cell aggregation, batch in situ
    visualisation, and flexible downstream analysis. Supports single-gene and
    multi-gene complex ligands/receptors (underscore-delimited). Built-in
    loaders for FANTOM5 and OmniPath LR databases.
